msgctxt "whats-new:1.4:Child"
msgid "## New features\n- **Remaining time reminders:** Reminders now appear by default. Reminders can appear over full-screen apps and can be customized in preferences.\n- **Request Time Form**: You can customize the preset times in preferences!\n"
msgstr "## Gnovis funzionalitâts\n- **Memoris dal timp che al reste:** Lis memoris cumò a comparissin par impostazion predefinide. Lis memoris a puedin comparî parsore des aplicazions a plen schermi e a puedin jessi personalizadis tes preferencis.\n- **Modul par domandâ timp**: Tu puedis personalizâ i timps predefinîts tes preferencis!\n"
